	I am surpised you have never had AC better than -8 and gone through
 hell. If you used gray dragon scale mail (-9), hard hat (-2), hard shoes (-2),
 large shield (-2), gloves(-1), elven cloak(-1) you would have an AC of -7. 
This I think would be the bare minimum one would have after the first 25 odd
levels. I personally do not venture into Hell, without AC of atleast -20.
Minotaurs can make mincemeat of you, if you have low AC.

	THere are several ways, to improve AC:







Spoilers (may be)

1. Using blessed scrolls of enchant armour. You can enchant your armour by
   +1 to +3 (random) each time you read one. Also it is better to selectively
   read them, like improving you dexterity, by enchanting guntlets of dexterity
   etc. For more info. refer to spoiler files.

2. Scrolls of enchant armour are not that easy to find. I have never found
   more than 7 in one game (some in hell). So you can wish for some.
   Something like "3 blessed scrolls of enchant armour". You can also try
   to use magic markers to write scrolls of enchant armour on blank scrolls.
   This is a more difficult option, as it does not work most of the time. You
   might end up with some other scroll (like identify etc.)

3. I think the best way to find armour (with enchantment) is just look around 
   in the armour of the monsters that you kill. Some of them are cursed, some
   are blessed with good enchantments. This is where playing Priests is very
   advantageous, as they can identify the blessed/cursed status of stuff. 
   Otherwise, you will need an altar. I generally try on all the blessed or
   uncursed armour that I find. I have found "blessed +3 hard shoes"(-5),
   "blessed +2 plate mail"(-9), "+2 hard hat"(-4) etc.
   This works for weapons also. I once found a +5 scimitar on a Mordor Orc.

4. Ever wondered what all that gold was good for except for shops ?? You can
   get AC improved by giving like aligned temple priests 400*Char. Exp. Level
   in gold. Use #chat for that. Refer spoiler files.

5. You have probably found military barracks by now, in some of your games.
   Take all the rings that you find in the barracks (they are rings of 
   protection) and find their blessed/cursed status. Try on the uncursed ones.
   You might rings of protection with enchantments anywhere from +1 to +4. 
   Soldiers in the castle level also have them. By the way this is also a 
   good place to look for armour.

6. Of all the cloaks, cloak of protection has the best AC (-3). Intrinsic 
   invisibility is a good thing to have.



	These are all the methods I can think of right now. There are also a 
few nethack abuses that you can perform to get very high AC. The highest AC
you can get is -127. You can use the abuses to get this type of AC, but this
takes the fun out of the game !! 


